        <item>
            <title>0.14.73</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 26 Jun 2026 09:57:50 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>134</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.14.73</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>The global record shortcut is gone entirely. Recording starts and stops from the menu-bar popover and the in-app button only; there is no keyboard shortcut anymore and the Shortcut row in Settings was removed.</li>
<li>The Library window now has a minimum size (920 x 600) so it can no longer be resized small enough for the sidebar, transcript, and right panel to overlap into an unusable layout.</li>
<li>The sign-in card no longer clips on a short window; if it&#x27;s taller than the window it scrolls instead of cutting off the bottom.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
